## Pydantic Models

User modelleri `app/models.py`'de tanımlı:

```python
from pydantic import BaseModel
from typing import List, Optional

class User(BaseModel):
    username: str
    token: str
    created_at: str
    updated_at: Optional[str] = None

class UserInDB(BaseModel):
    users: List[User] = []
```
